# Shippable product only

This repo ships **buusdo Cybersecurity Service Tool** — a **separate** product in the Buusdo product **line** (not the Buusdo line itself, not other Buusdo products). Legacy code/paths may still say Preventive Shield; user-facing product name is **buusdo Cybersecurity Service Tool**.

- Do **not** add demo, mock, fictional-only, teacher-demo, or “controlled demonstration” product UI.
- Every user-facing feature must be something that can go live: real flows, real brands/signals where shown, reversible local choices, bilingual EN / pt-PT.
- Test fixtures (e.g. `.test` hosts in `tests/` / evaluation) may stay for automated checks — never surface them as the product experience.
- Prefer completing the **website** (`app/`, `components/`, `security/`) before polishing the extension or desktop app.
- Visual language is the instrument system in `shared/tokens.css` (dark field, sharp corners, orange Halt). Do not reintroduce the cream / mint / Georgia legacy look.
- Brand assets: `public/brand/buusdo-logo.png` (full mark + tagline) and `public/brand/buusdo-wordmark.png` (header lockup).
- If asked for a “demo”, implement the real product path instead (or a thin fixture behind tests only).